  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assessment and mitigation of hawksbill consumption in Ecuador&apos;s Jambeli Archipelago.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will 1. Recruit and train field personnel to spend 2 weeks at Equilibrio Azul&apos;s research station at Puerto Lopez in the Manabi province; 2. As part of the outreach effort, the recipient will crerate a websitem website app and database to promote the project and educate the public on hawksbill conservation; 3. Conduct interviews with fishermen to document local knowledge of marine turtles; 4. and Hold two workshops with key stakeholders in Ecuador and distribute educational material on hawksbills.</narrative>
  </description>
